WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.801
How do I set a rep's shift time, automatic check-out and route on the map in Field Sales?

2
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:11.765
In the sidebar, click Sales reps, then click the Edit icon on the rep's row. The Edit rep window opens.

3
00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:23.498
Scroll down to Field location restrictions and turn on Idle check-out reminder, then automatic check-out. Then set the idle minutes before the reminder and the response window before automatic check-out.

4
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:31.196
Right below it is Show route on map. Keep it on to draw the rep's path on the tracking map, or turn it off to hide only the path.

5
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:38.453
In Shift time for alerts, choose the shift start and end times, then click the weekdays to set the rep's working days.

6
00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:43.453
Click Save changes at the bottom of the window, and the new settings apply to the rep.
